    "Actual healthy Local first-run has three phases. Genuine Next/Back plus documented preview Hello/Back cover the changed shared slide. Four-phase backend addition/4-to-3 collapse is covered by existing functional unit and compiled CSS guards, not claimed as live backend-down/public authentication proof.",
